  "description": "vCard contacts for Elarion (ADR-0110): ContactReader reads .vcf files of vCard 2.1, 3.0 and 4.0 from any common producer leniently into contacts, with every property kept in a lossless list and every error coded and located; ContactWriter writes contacts as vCard 3.0 or 4.0, deterministically and forward-only. No reflection and no third-party library, so an application keeps publishing with NativeAOT.",
